    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Elevate your <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WooCommerce</a> store with <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a>, a powerful Ajax search plugin designed to transform product search into a seamless and intuitive experience. With real-time Ajax-powered search results, smart filtering capabilities, and advanced indexing, <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a> ensures your customers can quickly find products with ease.</p>\n<p>Tailor the search functionality to your store&#8217;s unique needs using customizable options, including the Product Search Gutenberg Block, which integrates effortlessly into your WordPress editor for a cohesive design. Boost usability, enhance conversions, and deliver a superior shopping experience with <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a> — your ultimate <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WooCommerce</a> search solution.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Real-Time Ajax Product Search with instant results</li>\n<li>Instant Add to Cart &amp; Product Quick View</li>\n<li>Advanced Filter Options (Category, Price, Attributes, Rating, Tags)</li>\n<li>Seamless Integration with Gutenberg Blocks</li>\n<li>Customizable Search Bar Layouts</li>\n<li>Advanced Sale/Discount Display Options (Text, Amount, Percentage)</li>\n<li>Full-Screen Layout Option</li>\n<li>User-Friendly Dashboard</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later license. See <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LICENSE</a> for more details.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Minimum Requirements</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress 6.0 or newer</li>\n<li>WooCommerce 7.6 or newer</li>\n<li>PHP 7.3 or newer (recommended)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Installation</h4>\n<p>Install and activate the <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WooCommerce</a> and <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a> plugins. Once both are activated, you&#8217;re all set to go.</p>\n<h4>Direct from the Dashboard</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to WP Admin Dashboard &gt; Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Search for &#8220;QuiqOwl&#8221;</li>\n<li>Click Install Now, and then activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"is%20quiqowl%20for%20free%3F\">\nIs QuiqOwl for Free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it&#8217;s free and provides additional premium features.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20do%20i%20report%20security%20bugs%3F\">\nWhere do I report security bugs?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can report any security bugs found in the source code of this plugin through the <a href=\"https://patchstack.com/database/vdp/quiqowl\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Patchstack Vulnerability Disclosure Program</a>. The Patchstack team will assist you with verification, CVE assignment and take care of notifying the developers of this plugin.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.4 &#8211; August 24, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update: Compatible with WordPress 7.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3 &#8211; April 30, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update: Compatible with WordPress 6.8</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2 &#8211; February 18, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Block render style</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1 &#8211; January 08, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested: Upto WordPress v6.7</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0 &#8211; January 02, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "QuiqOwl integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce, offering customizable search options, smart filtering, and advanced indexing.",
    "description": "<p>Elevate your <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WooCommerce</a> store with <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a>, a powerful Ajax search plugin designed to transform product search into a seamless and intuitive experience. With real-time Ajax-powered search results, smart filtering capabilities, and advanced indexing, <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a> ensures your customers can quickly find products with ease.</p>\n<p>Tailor the search functionality to your store&#8217;s unique needs using customizable options, including the Product Search Gutenberg Block, which integrates effortlessly into your WordPress editor for a cohesive design. Boost usability, enhance conversions, and deliver a superior shopping experience with <a href=\"https://untapwp.com/quiqowl/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">QuiqOwl</a> — your ultimate <a href=\"https://woocommerce.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WooCommerce</a> search solution.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Real-Time Ajax Product Search with instant results</li>\n<li>Instant Add to Cart &amp; Product Quick View</li>\n<li>Advanced Filter Options (Category, Price, Attributes, Rating, Tags)</li>\n<li>Seamless Integration with Gutenberg Blocks</li>\n<li>Customizable Search Bar Layouts</li>\n<li>Advanced Sale/Discount Display Options (Text, Amount, Percentage)</li>\n<li>Full-Screen Layout Option</li>\n<li>User-Friendly Dashboard</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later license. See <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LICENSE</a> for more details.</p>\n",
